    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This well located three bedroom semi detached property is situated in the mature residential area of Rockenham, within walking distance of a wide range of local amenities. Nearby facilities include primary and secondary schools, a post office, shops, takeaways, bars, Aldi and Tesco Express.\r\n\r\nWaterford Golf Club is also just a 10-minute walk away, while a regular daily bus service operates nearby. Waterford City Centre is approximately a five minute drive from the property.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, sitting room, living room, kitchen, utility room and two shower rooms on the ground floor. Upstairs, there are three bedrooms, while the property also benefits from a converted attic space, providing additional versatile accommodation.\r\n\r\nThe property is heated by gas fired central heating and features PVC double-glazed windows throughout.\r\n\r\nExternally, the front of the property offers a spacious cobblelock driveway with parking for up to three cars. To the rear, there is a private garden laid out in patio, providing a low-maintenance outdoor space.\r\n\r\nViewings are highly recommended on this property and can be arranged through Sole Agents Barry Murphy Auctioneers.\r\n\r\n\r\nGround Floor\r\nEntrance Hall: 4.13m x 1.91m. Wood floor.\r\nSitting Room: 3.34m x 4.04m. Wood floor, fireplace with gas fire.\r\nLiving Room: 4.31m x 4.03m. Wood floor, fireplace with gas fire, door to garden, open to\r\nKitchen: 4.14m x 2.59m. Tiled floor, fitted kitchen, sliding door to rear garden.\r\nUtility: 1.2m x 2.07m. Tiled floor, plumbed for washing machine.\r\nShower Room: 0.72m x 1.53m plus 1.22m x 0.75m. Partially tiled, WC, wash hand basin, electric shower.\r\nWet Room: 1.77m x 1.88m. Fully tiled, WC, wash hand basin, shower.\r\nFirst Floor\r\nBedroom 1: 3.54m x 3.6m. Laminate floor, fitted wardrobes.\r\nBedroom 2: 2.42m x 4.06m. Wood floor.\r\nBedroom 3: 2.58m x 2.42m. Laminate floor.\r\nAttic Room: 4.33m x 5.05m. Laminate floor."
      },
